<title>INDIA: India Essar Oil gets $14.5 mln contract.</title>
<headline>India Essar Oil gets $14.5 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Essar Oil Ltd said on Tuesday it has been awarded a $14.5 million oil drilling contract in Oman.</p>
<p>A mobile rig is being shipped to Oman from India and drilling will begin this year, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>The four-year contract was given by Royal Dutch/Shell Group's affiliate Petroleum Development Oman, it said.</p>
<p>Essar Oil already operates eight rigs in the Middle East, six in Oman and two in Qatar. With the latest order, it currently has contracts worth $112 million, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
